UTILITY: sh (BusyBox ash)
ADMITTED: set -eu, printf, test, command -v, trap, wait, read, case, for, while, if, $(( ))
BANNED: eval, echo for formatted output, [[ ]], function keyword, local, arrays, timeout
EXIT_STATUS: propagate every nonzero status; no pipefail assumption
RATIONALE: sole process orchestrator; no business logic
